  "description": "VIZZEM crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H93 Eu3 N10 O19,5.4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu1A? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors; Eu2A? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors; Eu3A? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors; Eu1B? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors; Eu2B? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors; Eu3B? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors; Eu1C? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors; Eu2C? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors; Eu3C? (Eu) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 10 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.525-3.563 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.33-97.49°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu3L(μ3-OH)2(NO3)4(H2O)2]·5.4CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
  "interpretation_limit": "Oxidation states, nuclearity, oxo/hydroxo bridging, core charge and ligand identities/counts require article/SI or manual verification; atom-site counts are asymmetric-unit counts, not molecular stoichiometry. Graph topology is limited to identity-symmetry bonds in the CIF table. Approximate shape is based only on bridge-unwrapped metal-site coordinates in the largest component; symmetry-related bonds or periodic structures require manual crystallographic review. Empirical formulas alone do not establish unique oxidation-state assignments or ligand connectivity; annotations above reproduce explicit structural notation only.",
